    <section class="sg-section" id="icons">
      <h2>Icons</h2>
      <p class="lead">Icons are inline SVG, 24×24 viewBox, <code>stroke-width: 2</code>, <code>fill: none</code>, and <code>currentColor</code> so they inherit text color in light and dark modes.</p>
